        "# Part 7 — Chronos-Bolt Foundation Model (Google Colab, GPU)\n",
        "\n",
        "**Before running:**\n",
        "1. Runtime → Change runtime type → **T4 GPU**\n",
        "2. **Runtime → Restart session** (important if you've run this notebook before —\n",
        "   clears any leftover variables from earlier partial runs)\n",
        "3. Upload `energydata_hourly.csv` using the folder icon on the left (Files pane) →\n",
        "   upload → select the file from your computer (it's inside the pipeline zip,\n",
        "   in `data/energydata_hourly.csv`).\n",
        "4. Run all cells top to bottom (Runtime → Run all). Don't skip cells or re-run\n",
        "   out of order — that's the most common cause of mismatched array lengths.\n",
        "5. At the end, two files will appear in the Colab file browser:\n",
        "   `chronos_summary.json` and `15_chronos_forecast.png`. Download both\n",
        "   (right-click → Download) and send them back so the results can be folded\n",
        "   into the report and comparison table.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Sanity check:** Section 4's output should say `preds length: 24`. If you ever\n",
        "see a different number, restart the session and run all cells again from a\n",
        "clean state before trusting the results.\n"
      ]
